# Wireframe: Issue List

## Purpose & Flow Context

Primary screen for browsing and filtering issues. Entry: sidebar "Issues" nav or after login redirect. Exit: click issue row → Issue Detail; click "New Issue" → Issue Form modal.

---

## Notation Legend

| Symbol | Meaning | Symbol | Meaning |
|--------|---------|--------|---------|
| `[...]` | Button / interactive element | `[>...▼]` | Dropdown |
| `_______` | Text input / editable field | `[X]` | Close / dismiss |
| `⚠` | Warning / due date | `📎N` | N attachments |
| `💬N` | N comments | `🔗` | Card relationship |
| `👤` | User / mention | `○ ●` | Radio unselected / selected |

---

## Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column layout. Spacing cadence: 4px.

**App-shell**: Standard shell (sidebar, header, main).

| Region | Content | Notes |
|--------|---------|-------|
| Filter bar | Status, assignee, project, cycle dropdowns + clear filters | Below header, above list |
| Issue table | Table with columns: status, title, assignee, priority, due date | Primary content area |
| Empty state | Icon + message + CTA | When no issues match filters |

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Filter bar — first thing user sees, sets context
2. Issue table rows — scan for relevant items
3. Pagination / load more — at bottom

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  HEADER                                                   [🔔][👤] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Status▼] [Assignee▼] [Project▼] [Cycle▼]   [Clear filters]    |
|  [Search issues...]                              [+ New Issue]    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  ○ Issue-123  [In Progress]  Set up CI pipeline        👤JL  📎2 |
|  ○ Issue-122  [Todo]        Design system colors       👤JL  💬5 |
|  ○ Issue-121  [Done]        Auth module integration    👤MK    - |
|  ○ Issue-120  [Backlog]     API rate limiting          👤AN  📎1 |
|  ○ Issue-119  [In Progress] Cache invalidation rules   👤JL  💬3 |
|                                                                    |
|                                    [Load more...]  Showing 5 of 23 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Filter dropdown | DropdownMenu | Click opens filter options; selection updates store filter | Multi-select for labels; "Any" option clears |
| Search input | Input | Type to filter by title (debounced 300ms) | Empty → show all |
| New Issue | Button | Opens Issue Form modal | — |
| Issue row | Row (custom) | Click selects issue (store: selectedIssueId) + navigates to detail | Disable row click during loading |
| Status badge | Badge | Color-coded by status type | Maps to status group (backlog/todo/in-progress/done) |
| Priority icon | Icon (flag) | Colored by priority level | Urgent = red, High = orange, etc. |
| Load more | Button | Appends next page (pagination cursor) | Hidden when `hasMore=false` |

## Data Display

Table layout with columns:

| Column | Type | Sortable | Filterable | Notes |
|--------|------|----------|------------|-------|
| Status | Badge | Yes | Yes | Grouped by status type |
| Title | Text | No | Yes (search) | Primary link, wraps |
| Assignee | Avatar | Yes | Yes | Group by user |
| Priority | Icon | Yes | Yes | 4 levels + none |
| Due date | Text | Yes | No | Overdue = ⚠ warning |
| Attachments | Icon count | No | No | 📎N |
| Comments | Icon count | No | No | 💬N |

Row density: compact (36px row height). Sort by priority then updated date by default.

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Issues" heading | Page title | h1, route-driven |
| Filter placeholder | "Filter by status, assignee..." | Descriptive, not technical |
| "Clear filters" | Reset all filter state | Only visible when filters active |
| "+ New Issue" | Primary action CTA | Consistent across views |
| Load more | "Load more..." | Paging affordance |
| Empty filter result | "No issues match your filters" | Distinguish from first-run empty |
| First-run empty | "No issues yet — create the first one" | Guide-to-action |

## States

### Populated (Default)

Table with rows, as shown in the ASCII sketch. Store: `issues` populated, `isLoading=false`.

### Empty

No issues in project or all issues closed.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Filter bar]                                       [+ New Issue] |
|                                                                    |
|            [📋 Icon]                                              |
|            No issues yet                                          |
|            Create your first issue to get started                 |
|                      [+ New Issue]                                |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Loading

Skeleton rows mirroring table layout. Store: `isLoading=true`.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Filter bar]                                       [+ New Issue] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [skeleton row =====]  [====]  [==================]  [====]      |
|  [skeleton row =====]  [====]  [==================]  [====]      |
|  [skeleton row =====]  [====]  [==================]  [====]      |
|  [skeleton row =====]  [====]  [==================]  [====]      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Error

API fetch failed.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Filter bar]                                       [+ New Issue] |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [!] Could not load issues. Check your connection.  [Retry]      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Success / Confirmation

After creating an issue: list refetches, new issue appears at top, brief toast "Issue created".

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full table with all columns |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Priority and due date columns hidden; avatar instead of full name |
| Mobile (<768px) | Filters collapse to "Filter" button + bottom sheet; issue rows show title + status only |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` with `aria-label="Issues"`, `search` for filter area |
| Heading order | h1 "Issues" → h2 filter section → h3 (if group headers) |
| Reading / Focus order | Filter → search → "New Issue" → table rows → load more |
| Accessible names | "New Issue" button, "Load more" button, each filter dropdown |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through filters; Arrow keys in dropdown; Enter on row to open detail |
| Target size | Issue rows ≥24×24 CSS px clickable area; filter dropdowns ≥24×24 |
| Focus not obscured | Sticky header + filter bar do not cover table rows on focus |
| Non-color intent | Status uses badge shape + text, not color alone |

*Defer to design-system: pixel contrast, focus-appearance, per-component target-size/keyboard.*
